iconImage:ROOT:Resource/Image/Units/Button/Weapon/BeamCannon_1.png
description_zh:命令就绪炮位开火；有目标时各自瞄准，无目标时沿炮塔当前朝向发射。损坏或装填中的炮位跳过。
description:Order ready turrets to fire. Each turret aims at its own target; without a target it fires along its current barrel direction.
text_zh:光束枪齐射 [%{select(self.attachment(slot='MA_08_Turret_BeamGun_M1').hp>0 and not self.attachment(slot='MA_08_Turret_BeamGun_M1').readUnitMemory('breaked',type='bool') and not self.attachment(slot='MA_08_Turret_BeamGun_M1').readUnitMemory('MA_08_Turret_BeamGun_OnCD',type='bool') and self.attachment(slot='MA_08_Turret_BeamGun_M1').resource.MA_08_Turret_BeamGun_ShootTimer>0,1,0)+select(self.attachment(slot='MA_08_Turret_BeamGun_M2').hp>0 and not self.attachment(slot='MA_08_Turret_BeamGun_M2').readUnitMemory('breaked',type='bool') and not self.attachment(slot='MA_08_Turret_BeamGun_M2').readUnitMemory('MA_08_Turret_BeamGun_OnCD',type='bool') and self.attachment(slot='MA_08_Turret_BeamGun_M2').resource.MA_08_Turret_BeamGun_ShootTimer>0,1,0)+select(self.attachment(slot='MA_08_Turret_BeamGun_M3').hp>0 and not self.attachment(slot='MA_08_Turret_BeamGun_M3').readUnitMemory('breaked',type='bool') and not self.attachment(slot='MA_08_Turret_BeamGun_M3').readUnitMemory('MA_08_Turret_BeamGun_OnCD',type='bool') and self.attachment(slot='MA_08_Turret_BeamGun_M3').resource.MA_08_Turret_BeamGun_ShootTimer>0,1,0)+select(self.attachment(slot='MA_08_Turret_BeamGun_M4').hp>0 and not self.attachment(slot='MA_08_Turret_BeamGun_M4').readUnitMemory('breaked',type='bool') and not self.attachment(slot='MA_08_Turret_BeamGun_M4').readUnitMemory('MA_08_Turret_BeamGun_OnCD',type='bool') and self.attachment(slot='MA_08_Turret_BeamGun_M4').resource.MA_08_Turret_BeamGun_ShootTimer>0,1,0)+select(self.attachment(slot='MA_08_Turret_BeamGun_M5').hp>0 and not self.attachment(slot='MA_08_Turret_BeamGun_M5').readUnitMemory('breaked',type='bool') and not self.attachment(slot='MA_08_Turret_BeamGun_M5').readUnitMemory('MA_08_Turret_BeamGun_OnCD',type='bool') and self.attachment(slot='MA_08_Turret_BeamGun_M5').resource.MA_08_Turret_BeamGun_ShootTimer>0,1,0)+select(self.attachment(slot='MA_08_Turret_BeamGun_M6').hp>0 and not self.attachment(slot='MA_08_Turret_BeamGun_M6').readUnitMemory('breaked',type='bool')